{"id":"68f061fdc82867b9","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-cofinal.md","title":"Cofinal","display":"df-cofinal — Cofinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-cofinal","aliases":["93-df-cofinal"],"display":"df-cofinal — Cofinal","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-cofinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-cofinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cofinal — Cofinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,P\\in V\">\\(C,P\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq P^2\">\\(R\\subseteq P^2\\)</span> is a relation candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cofinal}_{93}\\)</span> is the cofinal-subset predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cofinal}_{93}(C,P,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;C\\subseteq P\\land R\\subseteq P^2\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cofinal}_{93}(C,P,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;C\\subseteq P\\land R\\subseteq P^2\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier and preorder axioms are part of the truth conditions, and every comparison is direct pair-membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>; cofinality therefore has neither a hidden domain nor an ambient order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq P^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cofinal}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cofinal}_{93}(C,P,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&C\\subseteq P\\land R\\subseteq P^2\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\;\\bigl(\n\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in R\n\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists c\\in C\\;(\\langle p,c\\rangle\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":988,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}